    "content_toggles_QtWei6": {
      "type": "content-toggles",
      "blocks": {
        "text_CmeaCc": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I move between belt colors?",
            "subtitle": "",
            "icon": "no-icon",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "body": "<p>As a member of Ninja Rewards, your reward level (belt color) is determined by your total spend on orders over a rolling 12-month period. This means we continuously monitor your spending from the past 12 months and place you in the level that corresponds to that total.</p><p><strong>Here's how it works:</strong></p><ul><li>White Belt: $0 - $249</li><li>Yellow Belt: $250 - $999</li><li>Blue Belt: $1,000 - $3,999</li><li>Black Belt: &gt; $4,000</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "text_T7gxcL": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "How much are points worth?",
            "subtitle": "",
            "icon": "no-icon",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "body": "<p>50 points = <strong>$1</strong></p>"
          }
        },
        "text_bxDbUp": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How is Ninja Cash earned?*",
            "subtitle": "",
            "icon": "no-icon",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "body": "<p>Customers earn cash back onevery dollar spent on Transfers. In the White Belt level, they'll earn 2% Cash Back on every $1 spent. The rate increases as customers move up reward levels. For Black Belt, they'll earn 10% Cash back for every $1 spent.<br/><br/>Ninja Cash is not earned on purchases of blanks or heat presses.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_wwgRkt": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What products earn Ninja Cash, and what products can points be redeemed for?",
            "subtitle": "",
            "icon": "no-icon",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "body": "<p><strong>You earn cash back on</strong>: DTF transfers, PermaStickers™, and DTF supplies. You do not earn cash back on Blanks, Patches, or Printhouse. </p><p><strong>You can use your Ninja Cash to purchase</strong>: DTF transfers, PermaStickers™, DTF supplies and Blanks. You are unable to use Ninja Cash on Patches and Printhouse</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_xCgNgc": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I redeem my Ninja Cash?",
            "subtitle": "",
            "icon": "no-icon",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "body": "<p>At checkout, your Ninja Cash will be stored in your shopify store credit. You can apply it on any order!</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_phXNfj": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "What are double points days?",
            "subtitle": "",
            "icon": "no-icon",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "body": "<p>Double point days are limited-time campaigns when you can earn 2x the number of points per dollar spent. We'll announce these through email ahead of time.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_DMhb7N": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does Ninja Cash Expire",
            "subtitle": "",
            "icon": "no-icon",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "body": "<p><strong>Yes.</strong> Ninja Cash expires 6 months after it is earned.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_LLiMJG": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I use my rewards with other discount codes or sales?",
            "subtitle": "",
            "icon": "no-icon",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "body": "<p><strong>No</strong>. Reward codes cannot be stacked with other discount codes or sales.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_qx7mAM": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Will my reward level be based on what I have already spent?",
            "subtitle": "",
            "icon": "no-icon",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "body": "<p><strong>Yes</strong>, customers with past purchases have been auto-enrolled into the appropriate reward level based off of their previous orders.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_VJtjgK": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What happens if I return items?",
            "subtitle": "",
            "icon": "no-icon",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "body": "<p>If you decide to return an order or any part of an order, any points that would have been earned from that order or item will be deducted from your reward balance.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_HAzqQF": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I join Ninja Rewards?",
            "subtitle": "",
            "icon": "no-icon",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "body": "<p>Simply <a href=\"https://ninjatransfers.com/account/login\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">create an account here</span></a>. Once you're signed in, you will start earning rewards!</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_KAGKx9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does it cost anything to join Ninja Rewards?",
            "subtitle": "",
            "icon": "no-icon",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "body": "<p>No, Ninja Rewards is free to join. There are no fees to become a member. All you need is to create an account!</p>"
          }
        }
      },
